@startuml agentic-product-capability-boundary
title Agentic Product / Agentic Capability Boundary , per ADR-ES-016 §10

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Capability" as C
class "Agentic Capability" as AC
class "Product" as P
class "Agentic Product" as AP

C <|-- AC : specializes

C --> P : may enable
AC --> AP : may enable

P <|-- AP : specializes

note right
  Per ADR-ES-016 §10 + APROD-NEG-002:
  - Agentic Capability does NOT automatically make every Product it enables agentic
  - Agentic materiality must be demonstrated at the Product boundary
end note

@enduml
